==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Treat this stage like you would [[Tapas Desert]]. To deal with Master A., either use a tanky cat like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], spam meatshields along with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], snipe him with a Cat that has longer attack range, or rely on the [[Cat Cannon]].

